@startuml
title ProtocolFilterWrapper 构建并执行 Filter 责任链

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  ActorBorderColor #1E40AF
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  ParticipantFontColor #172554
  GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

participant "ProtocolFilterWrapper" as Wrapper
participant "ExtensionLoader" as Loader
participant "Consumer Filter 链" as ConsumerFilters
participant "DubboInvoker" as Remote
participant "Provider Filter 链" as ProviderFilters
participant "业务 Invoker" as Business

Wrapper -> Loader: getActivateExtension(url, key, group)
Loader --> Wrapper: 按 @Activate 和配置排序的 Filters
Wrapper -> Wrapper: 从后向前包装 Invoker

ConsumerFilters -> ConsumerFilters: ConsumerContextFilter\n写入调用上下文
ConsumerFilters -> ConsumerFilters: Monitor / ActiveLimit 等
ConsumerFilters -> Remote: invoke(invocation)
Remote -> ProviderFilters: 网络请求
ProviderFilters -> ProviderFilters: ContextFilter 恢复上下文
ProviderFilters -> ProviderFilters: Token / ExecuteLimit 等校验
ProviderFilters -> ProviderFilters: Monitor 统计调用
ProviderFilters -> Business: invoke(invocation)
Business --> ProviderFilters: RpcResult 或异常
ProviderFilters -> ProviderFilters: ExceptionFilter 规范化异常
ProviderFilters --> Remote: Response
Remote --> ConsumerFilters: Result
ConsumerFilters -> ConsumerFilters: finally 清理线程上下文

note over ConsumerFilters,ProviderFilters
每个 Filter 只处理横切职责，并通过
next.invoke(invocation) 决定是否继续责任链。
end note
@enduml
